                                   'armed forces | information technology (IT) '
                                   'project manager – cybersecurity | network '
                                   'security engineer. Main duties: Confer '
                                   'with clients to identify and document '
                                   'requirements, assess physical and '
                                   'technical security risks to data, software '
                                   'and hardware | Apply encryption protocols, '
                                   'and manage keys to ensure  security of '
                                   'data is maintained while at rest and in '
                                   'transit | Monitor access and credentials '
                                   'for information and systems | Install, '
                                   'test and operate security software and '
                                   'tools such as anti-virus and automated '
                                   'threat detection/prevent systems to ensure '
                                   'security measures are in place and working '
                                   'as intended | Monitor for cyber attacks, '
                                   'intrusions and unusual, unauthorised or '
                                   'illegal activity | Plan and carry out '
                                   'security measures in response to '
                                   'cybersecurity events and incidents in '
                                   "accordance with an organization's incident "
                                   'response plan to protect information, data '
                                   'and systems | Document computer security '
                                   'and emergency measures policies, '
                                   'procedures, and tests.. Employment '
